+Dialogue: 0,0:00:-2.-47,0:00:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\pos(76,228)}WE HAVE FOUND A WITCH !\N{\an7}{\pos(76,243)}MAY WE BURN HER ?
