+Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\pos(38,197)}HOW DO YOU KNOW\N{\an7}{\pos(38,213)}SHE IS A WITCH ?\N{\an7}{\pos(153,243)}SHE LOOKS LIKE ONE !
