+Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\pos(38,243)}BRING HER FORWARD.
+Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.07,0:00:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\pos(115,228)}I’M NOT A WITCH.\N{\an7}{\pos(115,243)}\hI’M{\i1} NOT{\i0} A WITCH.
